{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-12-25 08:39:00', 'title': "NASA'S JAMES WEBB SPACE TELESCOPE LIFTS OFF WITH ADVANCED CAMERA FROM LOCKHEED MARTIN", 'text': "KOUROU, FRENCH GUIANA, DEC. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH THE LIFTOFF OF NASA'S JAMES WEBB SPACE TELESCOPE FROM FRENCH GUIANA TODAY, HUMANKIND IS ONE STEP CLOSER TO SEEING THE UNIVERSE IN A WHOLE NEW LIGHT, WITH HELP FROM A CAMERA BUILT BY LOCKHEED MARTIN [NYSE: LMT]. THE INSTRUMENT WILL BE KEY IN GIVING THE TELESCOPE ITS FIRST GLIMPSE OF CELESTIAL LIGHT."}